			    if(ABS(YTD_cy)<=10^6,format(YTD_cy,"#,##0,.00K"), 
			    if(ABS(YTD_cy)<=10^9,format(YTD_cy,"#,##0,,.00Mln"),
			    format(YTD_cy,"#,##0,,,.00Bn")))),"-")  
			&UNICHAR(10) &
			if(isblank(variazione),blank(),format(variazione,"+0.00%;-0.00%") )
			
			```
		displayFolder: Unit\Slide 7
		lineageTag: a86c1d92-7525-448e-819b-635d443ec6d7

