	measure 'Net Sales Euro Current Exchange' = ```
			
			
			VAR currnecy= SELECTEDVALUE('Currency Selector'[Currency])
			
			RETURN
			SWITCH(currnecy,
			        "Local", SUM(SCONTRINI[Net Sales Ccy]),
			        "Euro",sumx(SCONTRINI, DIVIDE(SCONTRINI[Net Sales Ccy], RELATED('SALES EXCHANGE CURRENT'[Exchange])))
			    )
			
			
			```
		displayFolder: Net Sales
		lineageTag: 8a1bc820-db40-4426-9714-6913cb602e7f

